WEBVTT

00:01.140 --> 00:03.940
<i>I, Grace, have a dream!</i>

00:04.260 --> 00:06.840
<i>It's to surround myself with hot guys</i>

00:06.840 --> 00:11.120
<i>and spend the rest of my life 
living comfortably on Santorini Island.</i>

00:15.630 --> 00:17.070
<i>And in order to do that...</i>

00:19.570 --> 00:22.130
<i>I've gathered intel, put it to use,</i>

00:22.130 --> 00:25.210
<i>and then killed, killed, 
and killed some more!</i>

00:25.660 --> 00:31.650
<i>Now, finally, my long-awaited dream 
is almost within my grasp.</i>

00:32.090 --> 00:34.800
<i>And she is the key.</i>

00:35.270 --> 00:38.640
<i>If I can take Xue's head...</i>

00:39.300 --> 00:43.780
<i>I'll be living the good life!</i>

00:48.920 --> 00:51.230
You just wait,

00:51.500 --> 00:52.730
Xue.

02:32.050 --> 02:34.340
Um... Ms. Yuki...

02:34.840 --> 02:38.470
I can't fall asleep if you keep 
staring at me like that.

02:34.840 --> 02:38.470
<b>Episode 5: What You Want to Protect.</b>

02:38.810 --> 02:44.480
But we have no way of knowing when that 
scoundrel will next appear, Master Hitoyoshi.

02:44.480 --> 02:45.680
Furthermore...

02:46.170 --> 02:50.900
Even a moment's lapse of attention on my part 
could be enough for her to dismember you.

02:51.360 --> 02:53.940
<i>I'm getting cut up into pieces now?</i>

02:54.260 --> 02:57.520
That is why, until I can find out 
more about that woman,

02:57.520 --> 03:00.090
I would like to be your bodyguard.

03:00.090 --> 03:03.490
Seriously? I really don't think I can sleep 
like this, so is there any other way?

03:04.860 --> 03:09.710
Then allow me to suggest a more 
sleep-friendly option, Master Hitoyoshi.

03:10.170 --> 03:10.920
What?

03:13.880 --> 03:18.410
Lending you my lap would restrict my movement, 
but please allow me to share your bed.

03:18.410 --> 03:21.970
<i>Ugh... Why can't I just say no?!</i>

03:23.290 --> 03:26.060
Anyway, I'm more worried about you, Ms. Yuki.

03:26.060 --> 03:29.430
She's more likely to be here 
for you than for me.

03:29.820 --> 03:33.420
For me... For me?

03:33.420 --> 03:36.150
<i>What's she so self-conscious 
about all of a sudden?</i>

03:36.150 --> 03:39.080
If I were to be attacked while asleep 
by someone of her level,

03:39.080 --> 03:42.090
I'd be able to handle it, 
with one hand at that.

03:42.090 --> 03:43.110
<i>With one hand...</i>

03:43.700 --> 03:48.130
During the day, I only had 
one small knife with me,

03:48.130 --> 03:50.970
so I'm glad I was able to scare her off.

03:50.970 --> 03:53.330
O-Oh, so that's what you were doing.

03:53.690 --> 03:58.260
I'm certain even she isn't foolish 
enough to attack me directly.

03:58.260 --> 04:01.550
<i>Is Ms. Yuki actually really strong?</i>

04:01.880 --> 04:04.840
I have no idea how she found out about me.

04:04.840 --> 04:08.010
It seems my past is catching up with me.

04:08.670 --> 04:11.280
And now I've involved you.

04:11.750 --> 04:15.900
But do not worry, Master Hitoyoshi.

04:16.680 --> 04:21.020
This is my foremost area of specialty.

04:21.860 --> 04:24.250
I will protect you,

04:25.110 --> 04:27.370
no matter what happens.

04:27.870 --> 04:33.330
As the one who taught me what kindness is, 
you are a very important person to me.

04:34.000 --> 04:38.380
S-Still, I can't help 
but worry about you, Ms. Yuki.

04:39.050 --> 04:44.120
I know there's nothing I can do, 
but I don't want to lose you, either.

04:45.090 --> 04:48.590
Very well. I will bear that in mind.

04:52.670 --> 04:56.140
It's getting a little hot in here. 
I'm gonna open a window.

04:56.140 --> 04:58.030
I will open it for you, just in case.

04:58.480 --> 05:01.380
We cannot discount the possibility of a sniper.

05:01.730 --> 05:05.200
<i>Is this what it's like for VIPs 
with bodyguards, too?</i>

05:07.910 --> 05:11.400
Oh... I-I smell Katsuda's Sauce...

05:11.400 --> 05:14.640
Huh? Are the neighbors having 
a midnight snack or something?

05:14.640 --> 05:15.960
No... This is...

05:17.020 --> 05:18.670
<i>Judging from the direction of the wind,</i>

05:18.670 --> 05:21.630
<i>the scent is coming from 
the front gate of this house!</i>

05:22.370 --> 05:23.840
<i>There's no mistaking it!</i>

05:26.370 --> 05:29.430
You've certainly lost your touch, Xue.

05:31.350 --> 05:36.560
It's not like you to fall 
for an easy trap like this.

05:36.560 --> 05:41.080
You're so distracted by this pretend family 
of yours that you're making dumb mistakes.

05:41.590 --> 05:44.780
I can't believe they used to call you 
the White Wolf of the Dragon's Nine.

05:45.140 --> 05:47.360
Now, now. Not so fast.

05:47.780 --> 05:53.540
You know even you can't kill me 
before I put this kid's eyes out.

05:53.930 --> 05:55.540
So be a good girl and...

05:54.750 --> 05:57.790
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

05:54.750 --> 05:57.790
<b>...You.</b>

05:55.910 --> 05:57.790
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

05:55.910 --> 05:57.790
<b>Do you understand what will happen to you</b>

05:57.790 --> 06:02.040
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

05:57.790 --> 06:02.040
<b>if you lay so much as a finger on him?</b>

05:59.960 --> 06:02.040
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

05:59.960 --> 06:02.040
<b>I will make you suffer so much,</b>

06:02.290 --> 06:09.050
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

06:02.290 --> 06:09.050
<b>you'll wish for a death that never comes.</b>

06:04.550 --> 06:09.050
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

06:04.550 --> 06:09.050
<b>So, are you ready to accept</b>

06:06.800 --> 06:09.050
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

06:06.800 --> 06:09.050
<b>the consequences of your actions?</b>

06:09.970 --> 06:15.520
I-I see. It seems the White Wolf 
hasn't completely lost her fangs yet.

06:15.980 --> 06:18.750
Well, the truth is, I have business with you.

06:18.750 --> 06:23.320
It's a very important matter. 
I simply must end your life.

06:23.730 --> 06:28.860
But with my strength alone, I wouldn't be 
able to kill you, even in a thousand years.

06:28.860 --> 06:32.280
So I'll be borrowing this boy 
for just a little while.

06:32.700 --> 06:35.490
Come to the school tonight at 2 AM.

06:35.760 --> 06:38.830
I'll guarantee his safety until then.

06:42.170 --> 06:45.870
<i>You were born to kill people.</i>

06:45.870 --> 06:49.380
<i>The stench of death forever clings to you.</i>

06:50.100 --> 06:53.350
<i>No matter how much you deny it, 
you will always be Xue.</i>

06:54.330 --> 06:58.310
<i>I know. I know, Mentor.</i>

06:58.730 --> 07:04.440
<i>If he'd never met me, Master Hitoyoshi 
wouldn't have had to face such danger.</i>

07:04.890 --> 07:07.770
<i>After all, this was a fleeting dream 
from the start.</i>

07:08.430 --> 07:11.450
<i>You have the composure of one 
who doesn't see people as people—</i>

07:11.450 --> 07:13.860
<i>a brutal killer.</i>

07:13.860 --> 07:18.490
<i>There is no other way for you to live.</i>

07:18.490 --> 07:20.810
<i>I will kill that woman</i>

07:20.810 --> 07:23.130
<i>and eliminate all traces of what happened.</i>

07:23.600 --> 07:26.360
<i>After I've ensured Master Hitoyoshi's safety,</i>

07:26.360 --> 07:29.820
<i>I will leave the country, 
and everything will resolve itself.</i>

07:30.340 --> 07:33.790
<i>And then I will simply return to living as Xue.</i>

07:34.750 --> 07:36.740
<i>Without me in the picture...</i>

07:40.660 --> 07:42.680
<i>Without me?</i>

07:44.840 --> 07:49.930
I know there's nothing I can do, 
but I don't want to lose you, either.

07:52.460 --> 07:55.170
<i>No, that's not right.</i>

07:55.170 --> 07:58.990
<i>What I... What I wish for is...</i>

08:00.100 --> 08:02.620
<i>The thing I want is...</i>

08:18.430 --> 08:20.930
<b>Ogiso Private High School</b>

08:30.570 --> 08:31.400
Yep.

08:32.110 --> 08:34.110
All done!

08:34.560 --> 08:36.040
Looking good!

08:36.040 --> 08:38.330
Being strung up really suits you.

08:38.330 --> 08:39.580
Like heck it does!

08:40.300 --> 08:42.480
You're right. Now that I think about it,

08:42.480 --> 08:44.680
you'd look great in bondage.

08:44.680 --> 08:46.250
Wanna give it a try next time?

08:46.250 --> 08:48.090
Pick a kink and stick with it!

08:48.480 --> 08:51.380
Hey, aren't you afraid?

08:51.380 --> 08:52.320
Huh?

08:52.990 --> 08:58.970
I have your tiny little life in the palm 
of my hand right now, you know?

08:58.970 --> 09:02.980
A life so insignificant that if I decided 
on a whim to crush it,

09:02.980 --> 09:04.850
it'd be gone, just like that.

09:04.850 --> 09:10.060
And you only have your Ms. Yuki to blame!

09:10.060 --> 09:13.860
How does it feel to have your life 
in danger because of that woman?

09:14.280 --> 09:15.950
Don't you hate her?

09:15.950 --> 09:17.950
Aren't you sad?

09:17.950 --> 09:20.410
Aren't you disappointed?

09:24.210 --> 09:27.470
No. To be honest, I'm really 
scared right now, but...

09:28.170 --> 09:31.920
Ms. Yuki told me she'd protect me.

09:32.250 --> 09:36.130
And the only thing I can do 
right now is believe in her.

09:37.020 --> 09:38.370
Hm...

09:39.140 --> 09:40.810
How boring!

09:40.810 --> 09:43.080
You've got more guts than I thought.

09:43.080 --> 09:45.400
Even though you look like a hamster.

09:47.020 --> 09:48.960
Well, I guess that makes sense.

09:48.960 --> 09:51.740
Not just anyone can tame Xue.

09:52.460 --> 09:55.570
In truth, I couldn't care less 
whether you live or die.

09:55.570 --> 09:58.450
I just want to kill Xue with my own hands.

09:58.780 --> 10:02.820
Sorry in advance if you get 
killed in the crossfire, 'kay?

10:02.820 --> 10:05.500
You're scarier when you 
talk like that, you know.

10:05.500 --> 10:08.250
And you keep mentioning this "Xue"...

10:08.250 --> 10:10.000
Is that Ms. Yuki?

10:10.270 --> 10:11.240
Huh?

10:11.240 --> 10:14.500
You were with Xue all this time 
without knowing her true identity?

10:14.990 --> 10:18.410
All I know is that she's a maid 
and former assassin.

10:18.410 --> 10:19.930
That's it?!

10:20.250 --> 10:21.590
She's...

10:22.060 --> 10:23.510
That woman...

10:23.930 --> 10:25.220
is a monster.

10:26.890 --> 10:30.420
I used to share my corner of the world 
with lots of real dangerous folk,

10:30.420 --> 10:33.040
but Xue was special even amongst them.

10:33.400 --> 10:38.860
She was a ruthless murderer with no mercy 
for anyone—a butcher who lived only to kill.

10:40.100 --> 10:43.620
The fourth of the Dragon's Nine:

10:44.090 --> 10:46.150
Xue the White Wolf.

10:47.660 --> 10:50.420
Th-The Dragon's Nine?

10:50.820 --> 10:54.980
The most powerful clan of assassins in the world. They gather talented individuals

10:54.980 --> 10:57.140
from various countries and train them.

10:57.450 --> 11:03.540
It's said that they're behind 
every major shakeup in history.

11:03.980 --> 11:06.640
But, precisely because they are 
such a powerful organization,

11:06.640 --> 11:09.690
there are many groups who oppose them!

11:10.100 --> 11:13.940
Put simply, if I can take the head of one 
of their members—in other words, Xue—

11:13.940 --> 11:16.250
my reputation will skyrocket!

11:16.250 --> 11:22.240
I'll be able to get the <i>real</i> good gigs—the high-
paying stuff—and make my dream come true!

11:23.670 --> 11:25.140
Hmm...

11:25.730 --> 11:28.360
Um... Who are we talking about again?

11:29.100 --> 11:30.750
Like I said, I'm talking about Ms. Yuki.

11:30.750 --> 11:33.010
The Ms. Yuki I know

11:33.010 --> 11:35.820
is a supposedly 16-year-old high school girl 
who jumps and falls a lot,

11:35.820 --> 11:39.660
is completely expressionless in one moment 
but super emotional in the next,

11:40.070 --> 11:44.470
naïve by nature but with a love for 
tonkatsu sauce unmatched by anyone...

11:44.470 --> 11:46.470
I couldn't believe it either!

11:46.470 --> 11:48.810
At first, I thought it was just 
someone who looked like her,

11:48.810 --> 11:52.970
so I observed her for about three weeks, 
but there's no doubt that she's Xue!

11:52.970 --> 11:54.770
The White Wolf of the Dragon's Nine!

11:55.450 --> 11:58.410
When you guys were talking 
about marriage on the porch,

11:58.410 --> 12:00.800
I thought about just shooting 
you both, there and then!

12:00.800 --> 12:04.110
Oh, uh... That conversation 
just kinda got out of hand.

12:04.110 --> 12:04.990
Stop blushing!

12:07.500 --> 12:09.790
I sort of understand now.

12:09.790 --> 12:11.960
There's something off about you.

12:12.860 --> 12:17.610
<i>No normal person would be able 
to stay calm in a situation like this,</i>

12:18.030 --> 12:22.860
<i>let alone carry on a conversation with 
someone who was prepared to kill them.</i>

12:24.970 --> 12:28.080
<i>There's something about him that isn't normal.</i>

12:28.970 --> 12:35.120
<i>Something that was able to thaw 
Xue's ice-cold heart of a killer.</i>

12:36.280 --> 12:38.940
<i>But that's even better for me!</i>

12:38.940 --> 12:42.940
<i>People become weaker the more invested 
they are in protecting something.</i>

12:43.330 --> 12:44.900
<i>Everyone knows that.</i>

12:44.900 --> 12:48.860
<i>And no one in our trade would be naïve 
enough not to take advantage of it.</i>

12:48.860 --> 12:52.660
<i>Assassins aren't honor-bound by rules.</i>

12:53.290 --> 12:57.800
<i>And that's why even I have a path to victory!</i>

13:11.860 --> 13:14.480
<i>Come to me, monster.</i>

13:20.320 --> 13:24.820
<i>Become the first stepping stone 
on the road to my dreams!</i>

13:26.320 --> 13:29.930
<i>Cutting bullets in half as you run? 
What is this, an action movie?</i>

13:30.640 --> 13:31.870
<i>But that's...</i>

13:31.870 --> 13:33.160
<i>nothing I can't handle!</i>

13:37.910 --> 13:40.340
One well-done maid, coming right up!

13:40.340 --> 13:43.420
Whaddaya call this? "Better watch your step"?

13:43.420 --> 13:45.470
No... Ms. Yuki!

13:46.460 --> 13:49.050
My, did I overdo it a bit?

13:49.420 --> 13:52.470
Well, I'm sure it'll take more than 
one measly trap to kill Xue...

13:55.680 --> 13:57.440
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

14:05.800 --> 14:08.700
Ms. Yuki! I'm so glad you're okay!

14:08.700 --> 14:10.740
I'm glad you are, too, Master Hitoyoshi!

14:10.740 --> 14:12.410
I'll save you right away!

14:12.410 --> 14:14.350
Ah, this sucks!

14:14.350 --> 14:19.120
First you dodge my landmines, 
and then you give me the cold shoulder?

14:19.120 --> 14:23.210
That's not normal, you know,

14:24.410 --> 14:25.840
Xue!

14:26.420 --> 14:32.890
You sure are taking me lightly 
by attacking me head-on, Xue.

14:33.230 --> 14:37.020
Oh, I'm sorry, was it "Ms. Yuki" now?

14:38.390 --> 14:44.700
I heard you kept your identity a secret, 
but isn't that because you still feel guilty?

14:45.180 --> 14:47.210
That's right, you're the great Xue,

14:47.210 --> 14:50.140
the youngest member of the 
Dragon's Nine in history!

14:50.810 --> 14:54.990
If he found out who you really were, 
you wouldn't be able to stay here anymore.

14:56.950 --> 14:59.730
You wanted to be normal, was it?

14:59.730 --> 15:02.510
There is no way you'd ever—

15:00.700 --> 15:02.510
Are you quite finished talking?

15:03.440 --> 15:06.170
Master Hitoyoshi has school tomorrow.

15:06.170 --> 15:09.450
Staying up any later than this 
would be bad for his health.

15:10.660 --> 15:12.470
Let us finish as quickly as possible.

15:12.470 --> 15:13.430
<b>SNAP</b>

15:12.470 --> 15:13.430
<b>MEOW</b>

15:13.430 --> 15:15.640
"Master Hitoyoshi," "Master Hitoyoshi"!

15:15.640 --> 15:17.890
Is that all you have to say?

15:20.100 --> 15:28.190
<b>Ms. Yuki's
Happy Meal of Love</b>

15:20.420 --> 15:23.150
Right now, I am thinking of 
Miss Riko and Agemochitaro.

15:23.150 --> 15:26.140
Katsuda's Sauce is also constantly on my mind.

15:26.140 --> 15:28.190
<i>Why does she hold them in such high regard?!</i>

15:28.830 --> 15:32.200
Goodness. You certainly 
are taking this lightly.

15:34.340 --> 15:36.650
<i>Is Ms. Yuki wary of something?</i>

15:37.150 --> 15:38.970
Oh, or is it...

15:39.650 --> 15:45.260
that the great Xue is too cold-hearted 
to mind the boy losing an arm or two?

15:45.260 --> 15:46.290
Yikes!

15:47.170 --> 15:52.700
Hey! I've still got some fun in store, 
so don't rush it, 'kay?

15:57.980 --> 15:59.930
L-Laser sniper rifles?!

16:00.260 --> 16:01.790
That's right!

16:01.790 --> 16:04.650
As you can see, 
if you resist even a little bit,

16:04.650 --> 16:08.110
dear Hitoyoshi here will be reduced to a torso!

16:08.110 --> 16:11.490
So just behave and let me beat you to death—

16:12.320 --> 16:13.030
Hey!

16:13.030 --> 16:15.820
<i>How can she just rush in 
without a moment's hesitation?!</i>

16:15.820 --> 16:19.450
<i>Xue the White Wolf 
never lets her prey get away.</i>

16:19.450 --> 16:23.930
Ha! I see! Some "normal" you wanna be!

16:23.930 --> 16:27.040
You didn't care one whit 
about the boy's life to begin with!

16:27.410 --> 16:29.630
You really had me going, you know!

16:29.630 --> 16:34.380
If you want it that badly, I'll put some 
nice, big holes into the boy's limbs...

16:34.380 --> 16:37.140
so you can hang him up to decorate your room!

16:48.230 --> 16:50.190
<i>She used her knives to deflect the bullets?!</i>

16:50.530 --> 16:53.290
<i>I screwed up by adding the laser sights 
to make it more threatening!</i>

16:53.290 --> 16:56.240
<i>No, nobody would expect a stunt 
like that to even be possible!</i>

16:56.240 --> 16:58.070
<i>But I'm not out of options yet!</i>

16:59.530 --> 17:00.790
<b>CRACK</b>

17:00.790 --> 17:03.580
Mrow! My smartphone!

17:05.390 --> 17:07.000
<i>Member...</i>

17:07.130 --> 17:09.380
<i>of the strongest clan of assassins,</i>

17:09.960 --> 17:12.590
<i>Fourth of the Dragon's Nine...</i>

17:13.310 --> 17:15.610
<i>This is Xue the White Wolf!</i>

17:15.610 --> 17:17.280
You lose.

17:17.800 --> 17:18.800
Ugh!

17:25.800 --> 17:28.350
<i>Not good! Not good! She's going to kill me!</i>

17:28.680 --> 17:32.140
<i>I have no choice but to create 
an opening and make my escape!</i>

17:32.140 --> 17:35.320
You think you can just kill me 
and live happily ever after?

17:35.610 --> 17:38.530
No matter how much you try, 
you'll never be Ms. Yuki!

17:38.860 --> 17:40.400
You're Xue!

17:40.400 --> 17:42.950
You know it more than anyone else!

17:42.950 --> 17:45.070
You really are foolish, you know that?

17:45.070 --> 17:52.080
No one just quits a job like ours—
the talented ones like you least of all!

17:52.080 --> 17:54.380
Even if you kill me right now,

17:54.380 --> 17:57.820
countless others will come after your head 
to make a name for themselves.

17:58.360 --> 18:00.600
Do you intend to kill all of them?

18:00.600 --> 18:03.280
Is that what you consider "normal"?!

18:03.820 --> 18:05.060
Ms. Yuki...

18:06.070 --> 18:07.310
You're right...

18:07.310 --> 18:11.080
That was my idea of "normal" until now.

18:11.080 --> 18:13.530
The more I killed, the more recognition I got.

18:14.170 --> 18:16.990
That was all I knew how to do.

18:17.550 --> 18:20.880
I thought that was the only place I belonged.

18:21.880 --> 18:26.420
But everything is different now. 
I won't kill anyone anymore.

18:27.510 --> 18:31.500
And I won't let anyone die 
because of me, either!

18:33.470 --> 18:35.620
No matter what happens from here on out,

18:36.110 --> 18:42.570
I will do my best to protect the normal life 
I obtained of my own free will!

18:47.480 --> 18:51.790
<i>Xue the White Wolf 
never lets her prey get away.</i>

18:52.300 --> 18:54.690
<i>She will chase them to the ends of Hell.</i>

18:54.690 --> 19:02.200
<i>No matter where you hide, she will emerge 
from the darkness to slit your throat.</i>

19:02.200 --> 19:05.900
<i>The strongest, most horrible assassin...</i>

19:05.900 --> 19:07.160
<i>Those rumors...</i>

19:07.860 --> 19:12.900
<i>I thought they were tales told about her 
exploits and methods of killing, but...</i>

19:13.870 --> 19:17.590
<i>That's not it. She's probably just...</i>

19:18.050 --> 19:19.440
Are you all right?

19:19.440 --> 19:20.610
I'm fine. I'm fine.

19:20.610 --> 19:27.020
<i>...a naïve, willful woman who won't 
stop until she gets what she wants.</i>

19:27.560 --> 19:28.560
<i>Just like back then...</i>

19:29.170 --> 19:30.800
<i>and just now, as well.</i>

19:31.730 --> 19:37.260
<i>So if she really wanted me dead, 
she would have killed me a long time ago?</i>

19:41.690 --> 19:44.830
I really thought I was a goner!

19:45.230 --> 19:48.410
Oh, man. I get to live after all.

19:49.260 --> 19:52.180
Those two are really interesting!

19:56.650 --> 20:00.090
Oh, boy. That was one thrilling day.

20:00.090 --> 20:04.260
Well, I had faith that you'd come 
and save me, Ms. Yuki.

20:04.740 --> 20:06.020
Master Hitoyoshi.

20:08.050 --> 20:12.820
I can't apologize enough for involving you 
in such a perilous situation.

20:13.550 --> 20:16.520
It is all my fault.

20:19.380 --> 20:22.380
If it's what you desire, then...

20:24.830 --> 20:27.510
I shall disappear from...

20:30.140 --> 20:33.610
I shall... disappear from...

20:38.940 --> 20:40.360
Hey, Ms. Yuki.

20:43.250 --> 20:46.080
Please teach me some 
self-defense techniques after this.

20:49.940 --> 20:52.280
I'm supposed to be a man, you know?

20:53.510 --> 20:56.340
So I want to be able to help you 
at least a little, Ms. Yuki!

21:08.930 --> 21:12.080
Yes! If you'll have me!
